{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もむしむししてたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/08/6544534/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しであみぷりぷりするとこだった(´･_･`)え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/08/6544534/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと。聞いてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ね、三年間で始めて定期をなくしまして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていうかすっごいお金無駄にしてしまった罪悪感という皮で包まれておる。いま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当やりきれない気持ちでうずうずする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/08/6544534/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生さんの皆様お気をつけを＿|￣|○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいじゃ、質問返しでも、いきましょうみだどもど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみはどうして古典嫌いになった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.身を乗り出してまで一生懸命理解しようとしてるのに、全くもってちんぷんかんぷんだったから ( ◞˟૩˟)◞  ふてくされちゃうよね？ぶう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.握手会わ、いろんな人がくるから、いろんな質問とか、あの何秒間にとっさに答えるって大変じゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.難しい質問の時とかは、人よりも理解が遅い能條にとっては、ちとアタフタしちゃうときはある。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいいんだよぉー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.男のメガネってどう思う？好きじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.めーっちゃ好き！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きめのやつも好きだしオシャレであみはかっこいいと思う(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.どんな形がいいとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.形とかこだわった事ないなぁー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもふちが、大きいのとか良いと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.車の運転が出来るのと、お酒が飲めるのどっちが楽しみですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.車の運転が出来るのがいいなぁ。なんか憧れるんだよね、助手席に座るみたいな(￣▽￣)お酒はあみまだ飲めないからいいや！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは動物に例えると何⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.なまけもの。本当友達にも言われるし、自分でもそう思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.緊張をしたらどうしてる⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もうどうもしない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その緊張感を、楽しむ(^_^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.メンバー誰かと遊びにいったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.休日にっていうのはまだないけど、普通に食べ行ったりっていうのは、永島せいらとか、大和とか、せっちゃんとか、まりかとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いるよ(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんは今はまっているものとかありますかぁ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ハマってるものかぁー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......ない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.サインは自分で考えたの？ほかに候補はあった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あれしか出てこなかった ╭(๑¯⌓¯๑)╮ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はもっとかっこいいサインが欲しいのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.乃木メンの中で『この子歌上手いなぁ』って思ったのは誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーあみかなぁー........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんもちろん嘘！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろとはピカイチだと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみゎお祭りで絶対いく出店ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そうだなー、わたあめとジャガバターは必ず食べる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/08/6544534/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わり(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好きよ。"}],"source":"archive"}